"test":{"name":"ui-fob-store-pips","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"fobStorePips","question":"A forward base's store shown as supply pips (SupplyDot, one per circle of a pip row under the building, as HealthDot for strength): Blue's FOB with 3 of 6 in store shows 3 filled and 3 faint, the seventh hidden; after spending one, 2; after refilling three, 5. The HQ keeps no store and shows none. A pip named 'circle (4)' is the fifth: filled with 5 in store, faint with 2. Under fog Blue sees its own FOB's pips always, Red's only while a Blue unit sees it.","rules":"standard"},
